cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AVT Time and Motion Recorder"
abstract: >-
  An offline web app for observers running time and motion studies of
  ambient voice technology (AVT) in clinical consultations. It times
  documentation and AVT set-up, logs interruptions, paused patients and AVT
  output errors, collects clinician workload (NASA-TLX), usability (SUS) and
  patient survey responses, and exports the data as an Excel workbook.
  Developed for the Moorfields Eye Hospital AVT pilot as part of the NHS
  Fellowship in Clinical AI.
authors:
